# Horsforth in Bloom - Project Overview

This is a Next.js 15 website for Horsforth in Bloom, a community volunteer group. The site uses modern React 19 features, Tailwind CSS v4, and shadcn/ui components.

## Core Technologies
- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router
- **React**: React 19 with modern features
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **TypeScript**: Full TypeScript support

## Project Structure
- `src/app/` - Next.js App Router pages and layouts
- `src/components/` - Reusable React components
- `src/components/ui/` - shadcn/ui components
- `public/` - Static assets (images, PDFs, etc.)

## Brand Colors
- **Orange**: `orange-400` - Primary actions, highlights, main brand color
- **Pink**: `pink-500` - Secondary elements, special highlights  
- **Green**: `green-400` - Nature/sustainability themes, accents
- Use subtle backgrounds: `bg-orange-50`, `bg-green-50`, `bg-pink-50`